<description>&lt;p&gt;The government has called seven people to stand trial for a plot to murder a candidate, while U.S. authorities have charged the son of Ecuador’s former president and four others with cocaine trafficking. A priest was killed when a crucifix fell from a church wall in the Galapagos. President Daniel Noboa continues to detain opposition leader Luisa González on money-laundering charges. The crisis recorded two battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxNaEtYWWlQYkV3TnUwRlRPaWpiMGdpVUptOVpFc1FZWm5Zb2FiSVg0Y2trMWdvMlFfSDJKcTI4N253VFRaNFE0UERqNHZpUkVGVnZRdWVsX2VHUnRBNmZhNjd2SDA5Z2V1T1F3bW9qTnBkUHpxak15WUlvX3Z4cHVIOXozRDU3bWFBYS15eGd6N1JkaVJHeHBOOXZrbHhKS05XZE5FNGw4Vk05c2x1VjQtRA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Fox 59&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE44M3ZNM2R4anJvMEswM2RsMlNxeFdLbkZaTVBrNTU2X1dPbEJqWk9ZUGc2eXdnRVRBWEhYSzdFbVZpSVhxMjlkQXpHbjBQLXE5UnpJZlMzUVIyM1RxMllZ0gFcQVVfeXFMUDJuTmJ6R1lpd1V3aHgwYThJYjVyVWNZNzNneG83ZFhCdTlaM3hhdHZWWXl6RGZpLVhsSW1qTVRmd2FDTkY4c2RoczliTTZGQVEyY1JMdEt3cnZqQ1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Ghana&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
